# DRIVE3D: the rally prototype at the settings it starts with: HIGH
# detail, 30 pictures a second (the game has no 60 setting).
# Run with --boot off --fps 30 --frames 567.
#
# Home screen: two steps right to the DRIVE3D tile, A (south) starts it.
90 press right
91 release right
93 press right
94 release right
110 press south
111 release south
# Full throttle (A held) from frame 150 to the end; the car runs straight
# down the gravel road, no steering needed until after the ford.
150 press south
# About 340: over the top of the crest at about 90 km/h; 350 to 365 the
# car is in the air, the valley and the river below it.
# About 420 to 495: through the ford, water thrown up by the wheels.
# After the ford the road bends hard right: steer right on the stick.
488 stick left 26000 0
512 stick left 32767 0
# About 520 to 550: the car slides through the right bend on gravel,
# throwing dust.
540 stick left 10000 0
560 stick left 0 0
